WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.461
Jeff!" cried Joy.

2
00:00:17.641 --> 00:00:19.742
The mail truck came up the driveway.

3
00:00:20.363 --> 00:00:22.964
Joy and Magoo leaped off the front porch.

4
00:00:24.125 --> 00:00:25.005
"Special delivery!"

5
00:00:25.526 --> 00:00:29.108
Jeff called and held a cardboard box out of the window.

6
00:00:30.772 --> 00:00:31.773
"Are they in there?"

7
00:00:32.434 --> 00:00:35.697
asked Joy, jumping up and down with excitement.

8
00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:38.939
"Steady now," said Jeff.

9
00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:42.122
He laid the box carefully in Joy's hands.

10
00:00:42.142 --> 00:00:45.745
"I hear them," she whispered.

11
00:00:45.765 --> 00:00:49.008
"They're moving around inside."

12
00:00:49.669 --> 00:00:52.071
She turned and started back toward the house.

13
00:00:53.732 --> 00:00:57.396
Magoo sniffed at the bottom of the box as Jeff drove off.

14
00:00:59.908 --> 00:01:03.771
Grandpa, Mom, and even Katie, waited at the front door.

15
00:01:03.791 --> 00:01:07.653
"Follow me, everybody," called Joy.

16
00:01:08.214 --> 00:01:11.336
She and the chicks went upstairs to the spare room.

17
00:01:11.356 --> 00:01:15.619
"I turned on the heat lamp," said Mom.

18
00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:18.861
She checked the thermometer in the box.

19
00:01:19.461 --> 00:01:21.723
"Perfect! Nice and warm."

20
00:01:24.645 --> 00:01:26.846
The chicks were chirping in their box.

21
00:01:26.866 --> 00:01:28.928
"Do you hear them?"

22
00:01:29.532 --> 00:01:30.192
asked Joy.

23
00:01:30.212 --> 00:01:32.393
"Yes, Joy.

24
00:01:32.593 --> 00:01:35.655
They want to come out and meet you," replied Grandpa.

25
00:01:35.675 --> 00:01:37.115
"Here are the scissors."

26
00:01:38.456 --> 00:01:41.997
Joy cut the bands around the box and lifted the lid.

27
00:01:42.017 --> 00:01:48.220
"Ooh!" squealed Joy when she saw the little balls of fluff inside.

28
00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:50.981
"Aren't they sweet?"

29
00:01:51.541 --> 00:01:52.202
said Mom.

30
00:01:52.222 --> 00:01:53.642
"Look, Katie."

31
00:01:54.723 --> 00:01:57.364
Katie had been standing back in the doorway.

32
00:01:58.492 --> 00:02:01.975
But now she stepped forward and peeked in the box.

33
00:02:03.576 --> 00:02:09.420
"One, two, three, four, five, six," counted Katie.

34
00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:10.761
"All there."

35
00:02:10.781 --> 00:02:16.345
"Let's put them in the box before they get cold," suggested Grandpa.

36
00:02:17.546 --> 00:02:20.788
One by one, Joy placed the chicks in the box.

37
00:02:22.029 --> 00:02:23.971
Mom had her chicken book open.

38
00:02:23.991 --> 00:02:29.421
"Now, it's important that they eat and drink," she stated.

39
00:02:29.441 --> 00:02:31.722
"Have they found the water, Joy?"

40
00:02:33.122 --> 00:02:36.923
Joy picked up a chick and put it next to the water feeder.

41
00:02:36.943 --> 00:02:41.224
"Look!" she exclaimed and clapped her hands.

42
00:02:41.244 --> 00:02:42.885
"It's drinking!"

43
00:02:44.185 --> 00:02:47.226
Just then Dad stepped into the spare room.

44
00:02:47.866 --> 00:02:50.547
As usual his work clothes were dirty.

45
00:02:52.027 --> 00:02:54.388
Katie gave him a big hug anyway.

46
00:02:55.108 --> 00:02:58.231
"Everyone's looking at the chicks, Dad," she said.

47
00:02:58.251 --> 00:03:01.494
"But I have work to do in my room."

48
00:03:05.677 --> 00:03:06.898
look at these babies!"

49
00:03:07.559 --> 00:03:11.102
exclaimed Dad with a grin as he looked into the box.

50
00:03:12.723 --> 00:03:16.146
The chicks had been drinking water and pecking at their food.

51
00:03:17.267 --> 00:03:19.228
But now they were getting quiet.

52
00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:24.956
One little chick tipped over on its side and lay completely still.

53
00:03:24.976 --> 00:03:26.977
"What's wrong?"

54
00:03:27.557 --> 00:03:28.778
asked Joy, worried.

55
00:03:29.398 --> 00:03:31.798
She poked the chick lightly with her finger.

56
00:03:32.979 --> 00:03:34.319
Its eyes popped open.

57
00:03:34.339 --> 00:03:39.161
"The little one just fell asleep," whispered Grandpa.

58
00:03:39.721 --> 00:03:40.601
"She's tired."

59
00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:45.502
They watched the chicks fall asleep, one by one.

60
00:03:46.663 --> 00:03:48.683
Joy put her finger to her lips.

61
00:03:48.703 --> 00:03:51.124
"Shh," she said.

62
00:03:51.788 --> 00:03:54.450
Everyone tiptoed out of the spare room.

63
00:03:55.671 --> 00:04:01.176
Joy pointed to a sign she had made for the door: "NO CATS ALLOWED!"

64
00:04:02.737 --> 00:04:05.339
Down the hall Katie was hard at work.

65
00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:10.203
She was taping a piece of red plastic over a flashlight.

66
00:04:10.683 --> 00:04:12.385
Luke had told her how to do it.

67
00:04:13.746 --> 00:04:18.449
Jellybean was sprawled on Katie's bed watching every move Katie made.

68
00:04:18.469 --> 00:04:27.215
"Jellybean," said Katie, "did you know that earthworms in Australia can grow to be three and a half

69
00:04:27.315 --> 00:04:28.175
meters long?"

70
00:04:29.596 --> 00:04:33.338
Jellybean blinked while Katie tore off another piece of tape.

71
00:04:33.358 --> 00:04:39.301
"And did you know that some earthworms live to be eight years old?"

72
00:04:40.482 --> 00:04:41.863
Jellybean blinked again.

73
00:04:41.883 --> 00:04:49.847
"HA! That's how old I am," exclaimed Katie as she smoothed the tape into place.

74
00:04:49.867 --> 00:04:55.172
"There!" She closed the curtains and turned off the light switch.

75
00:04:56.313 --> 00:04:58.615
Then Katie turned on the flashlight.

76
00:04:59.115 --> 00:05:02.038
A spooky red beam flashed around the room.

77
00:05:02.058 --> 00:05:04.761
"Great!" she said.

78
00:05:04.781 --> 00:05:07.384
"I'm ready for worm hunting!"
